WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:15.680
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:15.950 --> 00:16.700
Chen Ying.

3
00:17.350 --> 00:19.000
The police say the scene investigation

4
00:19.000 --> 00:20.480
points to suicide.

5
00:21.000 --> 00:22.860
But they'll keep investigating.

6
00:22.960 --> 00:24.480
If you have no objections,

7
00:24.670 --> 00:27.520
sign here so we can proceed with cremation.

8
00:28.550 --> 00:29.760
I know full well

9
00:31.120 --> 00:31.810
that this world

10
00:31.810 --> 00:33.450
isn't just black and white.

11
00:34.960 --> 00:36.000
But I am.

12
00:41.750 --> 00:42.640
I've always been fixated on

13
00:42.640 --> 00:44.500
seeing things in black and white,

14
00:44.920 --> 00:45.470
stubbornly

15
00:45.470 --> 00:47.430
digging up the truth and bringing it to light.

16
00:47.430 --> 00:48.670
Mom.

17
00:49.030 --> 00:50.200
But now,

18
00:52.810 --> 00:53.860
I'm scared.

19
00:53.190 --> 00:58.960
[Fire Hydrant]

20
01:01.280 --> 01:03.010
I'm sorry.

21
01:03.040 --> 01:05.180
I'm afraid that at the end of this road,

22
01:05.680 --> 01:07.360
I'll be all alone.

23
01:10.080 --> 01:11.970
I'm sorry.

24
01:16.750 --> 01:26.200
[Morgue]

25
02:52.610 --> 02:57.470
[Light the Dark]

26
02:57.760 --> 03:00.590
[Episode 4]

27
03:09.840 --> 03:10.960
Wait here.

28
03:11.120 --> 03:12.190
I'll walk you upstairs.

29
03:12.190 --> 03:13.160
No need.

30
03:13.400 --> 03:14.470
I'll be right back.

31
03:20.560 --> 03:20.960
Try it.

32
03:20.960 --> 03:21.520
You made this?

33
03:21.520 --> 03:22.860
Of course I did.

34
03:23.470 --> 03:24.730
Department Chief Sun.

35
03:25.120 --> 03:26.360
Deputy Department Chief Gao.

36
03:26.360 --> 03:27.820
I'd like to request leave.

37
03:27.980 --> 03:29.760
All right. You want time off?

38
03:31.280 --> 03:32.079
Look.

39
03:36.050 --> 03:37.140
Look.

40
03:37.530 --> 03:39.590
The plant director personally arranged for you

41
03:39.590 --> 03:41.840
to join our supply department.

42
03:41.960 --> 03:42.560
And we

43
03:42.560 --> 03:44.490
specifically saved a spot for you.

44
03:45.120 --> 03:46.640
Your family situation

45
03:46.660 --> 03:48.430
kept you from starting for so long.

46
03:48.430 --> 03:50.630
I won't bring that up again.

47
03:51.750 --> 03:53.120
We're so busy right now.

48
03:53.240 --> 03:55.520
Everyone's working overtime.

49
03:55.730 --> 03:58.010
You keep having people cover for you.

50
03:58.040 --> 04:00.240
Don't you think that's inappropriate?

51
04:01.630 --> 04:02.470
Department Chief Sun.

52
04:02.470 --> 04:04.030
Deputy Department Chief Gao.

53
04:04.030 --> 04:05.170
I'm asking for leave

54
04:05.710 --> 04:07.660
to bury my mother.

55
04:08.360 --> 04:09.150
Yes.

56
04:10.370 --> 04:11.450
About your mother,

57
04:11.800 --> 04:13.590
the chief and I both know.

58
04:13.690 --> 04:15.180
But you should also know

59
04:15.410 --> 04:16.399
our supply department

60
04:16.399 --> 04:18.000
is an award-winning team.

61
04:18.230 --> 04:20.140
This is our busiest time.

62
04:21.040 --> 04:21.560
Look.

63
04:21.560 --> 04:22.310
Every order

64
04:22.560 --> 04:24.440
on this desk

65
04:24.470 --> 04:26.090
is more urgent than your mother's

66
04:26.090 --> 04:26.970
cremation.

67
04:28.000 --> 04:28.920
How about this?

68
04:28.950 --> 04:30.050
You can honor your mother.

69
04:30.050 --> 04:31.260
Department Chief Sun.

70
04:31.260 --> 04:32.280
My request is reasonable.

71
04:32.280 --> 04:33.680
I have to take this leave.

72
04:35.000 --> 04:36.370
Honestly, I think

73
04:36.400 --> 04:38.190
you don't even need to ask me for leave.

74
04:38.190 --> 04:40.280
Just pack up your things

75
04:40.300 --> 04:41.470
and get out.

76
04:44.070 --> 04:45.320
You're firing me?

77
04:49.360 --> 04:50.040
The plant

78
04:50.060 --> 04:51.670
officially hired me.

79
04:52.360 --> 04:54.020
You have no grounds to fire me.

80
04:54.560 --> 04:56.240
I don't know if the plant

81
04:56.240 --> 04:57.070
has grounds to fire you.

82
04:57.070 --> 04:59.750
But there's no room for you here.

83
04:59.750 --> 05:01.320
Go wherever you want.

84
05:03.780 --> 05:04.840
Department Chief.

85
05:05.120 --> 05:07.000
Department Chief, you've barely eaten.

86
05:07.000 --> 05:09.130
Have a few more bites before you leave.

87
05:12.630 --> 05:13.430
You...

88
05:18.590 --> 05:20.480
[Letter of leave]

89
05:26.720 --> 05:27.930
Ms. Chen Ying.

90
05:28.310 --> 05:29.190
Isn't this decision

91
05:29.190 --> 05:30.390
a little rash?

92
05:31.160 --> 05:32.430
How is a young girl like you

93
05:32.430 --> 05:34.090
supposed to survive out there

94
05:34.310 --> 05:35.870
without this steady job?

95
05:37.390 --> 05:38.470
How about

96
05:39.360 --> 05:40.950
finding someone to take care of you?

97
05:40.950 --> 05:41.750
That way,

98
05:41.830 --> 05:43.159
you won't have to worry about getting by.

99
05:43.159 --> 05:44.220
What are you doing?

100
05:48.510 --> 05:49.870
I'm not doing anything.

101
05:51.040 --> 05:52.360
I've liked you since you first got here.

102
05:52.360 --> 05:52.690
Really.

103
05:52.690 --> 05:53.159
Let go of me!

104
05:53.159 --> 05:54.920
-Let go of me. I'll scream! -Be with me. And I'll talk to the leader

105
05:54.920 --> 05:56.240
-and get him to hire you back. -Let go of me!

106
05:56.240 --> 05:57.180
You pervert!

107
05:57.270 --> 05:58.409
You creep!

108
06:00.680 --> 06:01.770
You hit me?

109
06:04.870 --> 06:05.780
Your sister

110
06:05.800 --> 06:07.730
assaulted a government employee.

111
06:14.070 --> 06:15.030
You have a death wish.

112
06:15.030 --> 06:16.130
What are you doing?

113
06:18.040 --> 06:18.800
Shan.

114
06:18.800 --> 06:20.220
I'll beat you to death!

115
06:20.680 --> 06:21.880
You have a death wish.

116
06:21.920 --> 06:23.530
Shan, stop! Shan.

117
06:24.160 --> 06:24.870
Get up!

118
06:24.920 --> 06:25.720
Get up!

119
06:25.950 --> 06:27.750
Which hand did you hit Ying with?

120
06:32.190 --> 06:32.870
Shan!

121
06:33.070 --> 06:33.630
Shan!

122
06:33.630 --> 06:34.900
-I'll kill you. -Shan! No, Shan!

123
06:34.900 --> 06:36.159
-Shan! -Don't stop me!

124
06:36.560 --> 06:38.000
Shan, let go!

125
06:50.510 --> 06:52.100
Gao, don't worry.

126
06:52.630 --> 06:54.270
I've taken care of everything.

127
06:54.270 --> 06:56.130
The police will be here shortly.

128
06:57.270 --> 06:58.720
First, they'll document your injuries.

129
06:58.720 --> 07:00.040
Then they'll lock him up.

130
07:00.040 --> 07:01.500
Then he'll get sentenced.

131
07:03.750 --> 07:05.750
Throw the book at him.

132
07:05.830 --> 07:07.580
Right. Throw the book at him.

133
07:09.200 --> 07:10.020
They should be here soon.

134
07:10.020 --> 07:11.750
I'll meet them at the entrance.

135
07:12.120 --> 07:13.000
You rest up.

136
07:14.190 --> 07:15.450
What are you doing?

137
07:15.870 --> 07:17.570
Quit gawking and crowding in here.

138
07:17.570 --> 07:18.500
Don't you have work to do?

139
07:18.500 --> 07:19.830
Break it up! Go on! Go on!

140
07:21.160 --> 07:22.680
Stop crowding around. Go!

141
07:23.270 --> 07:24.240
Hey, Liu.

142
07:24.390 --> 07:25.500
The police

143
07:25.530 --> 07:26.310
should be here soon.

144
07:26.310 --> 07:28.050
Go meet their car at the entrance.

145
07:28.050 --> 07:28.600
Okay.

146
07:28.600 --> 07:29.420
Why are you just coming back?

147
07:29.420 --> 07:30.920
Didn't I tell you to secure the scene?

148
07:30.920 --> 07:32.770
Just roping it off isn't enough.

149
07:33.630 --> 07:35.290
How many times have I told you?

150
07:39.240 --> 07:40.130
Zhang. Zhang.

151
07:40.159 --> 07:41.870
Yes, it's me, Wang. Right.

152
07:41.950 --> 07:42.610
Didn't I just

153
07:42.610 --> 07:43.820
call you?

154
07:45.120 --> 07:46.520
I've already caught him.

155
07:47.390 --> 07:48.430
Are Liu and the others on their way?

156
07:48.430 --> 07:49.070
Ying.

157
07:50.190 --> 07:51.180
I'll be fine.

158
07:52.720 --> 07:53.780
Anyway, he...

159
07:54.240 --> 07:55.770
he won't get away with this.

160
07:57.390 --> 07:58.360
Stay out of it.

161
07:58.830 --> 07:59.430
Ying.

162
08:09.390 --> 08:11.050
Deputy Department Chief Gao.

163
08:12.360 --> 08:14.830
Shan was wrong to hit you.

164
08:15.720 --> 08:17.180
I apologize on his behalf.

165
08:18.750 --> 08:19.810
Please let him off.

166
08:28.000 --> 08:29.600
You know exactly

167
08:30.950 --> 08:32.360
why he hit you, don't you?

168
08:34.000 --> 08:35.750
If you won't let him off,

169
08:36.960 --> 08:38.400
I'll tell everyone

170
08:38.429 --> 08:39.429
why he hit you.

171
08:40.120 --> 08:40.909
Then,

172
08:41.909 --> 08:43.510
your wife will find out, too.

173
08:52.390 --> 08:53.390
Hello, everyone.

174
08:53.390 --> 08:54.720
I'm the supply department's

175
08:54.720 --> 08:56.380
accountant, Chen Ying.

176
08:56.480 --> 08:58.040
My brother Chen Shan was wrong

177
08:58.040 --> 08:59.240
to hit someone today.

178
08:59.320 --> 09:00.720
But he beat him that badly

179
09:00.840 --> 09:02.200
for a reason.

180
09:03.240 --> 09:04.030
Because...

181
09:04.150 --> 09:04.960
Wait!

182
09:05.960 --> 09:06.920
Wait, wait.

183
09:09.730 --> 09:11.580
I think Ying is right.

184
09:12.510 --> 09:14.140
Her brother is still young.

185
09:14.750 --> 09:16.350
We should give him a chance.

186
09:16.440 --> 09:18.490
We can't ruin his future.

187
09:18.790 --> 09:19.910
You...

188
09:40.080 --> 09:41.720
What a disgrace.

189
09:42.790 --> 09:44.520
He beat me up this badly.

190
09:45.550 --> 09:46.360
Don't worry.

191
09:46.440 --> 09:47.990
Leave it to me.

192
09:58.600 --> 09:59.330
Why don't we

193
09:59.360 --> 10:00.840
report that Gao guy?

194
10:02.440 --> 10:03.630
If I report him,

195
10:05.390 --> 10:07.320
he'll insist on pressing charges.

196
10:07.630 --> 10:09.080
If you get detained,

197
10:10.360 --> 10:11.690
it'll go in your record.

198
10:13.240 --> 10:14.150
Then,

199
10:15.030 --> 10:16.160
it won't be worth it.

200
10:19.870 --> 10:20.670
Ying.

201
10:21.510 --> 10:23.240
I don't care what happens to me.

202
10:23.440 --> 10:24.510
But I can't just stand by

203
10:24.510 --> 10:26.570
and let him get away with hurting you.

204
10:31.870 --> 10:32.670
Shan.

205
10:34.600 --> 10:36.150
You're all I have left now.

206
10:37.750 --> 10:39.150
I just want you to be safe.

207
10:45.200 --> 10:46.520
What took you so long?

208
10:46.720 --> 10:48.520
I've been waiting here forever.

209
10:48.670 --> 10:50.600
The higher-ups have made it clear.

210
10:50.600 --> 10:51.360
Your parents

211
10:51.480 --> 10:53.000
were only allowed to stay here temporarily

212
10:53.000 --> 10:54.390
when they were going through a hard time.

213
10:54.390 --> 10:56.080
It wasn't assigned as employee housing.

214
10:56.080 --> 10:57.750
The plant is taking it back

215
10:57.790 --> 10:59.120
to put it to another use.

216
11:00.080 --> 11:01.930
What are you standing around for?

217
11:01.930 --> 11:03.330
Should I get some people

218
11:03.350 --> 11:04.030
to help you move?

219
11:04.030 --> 11:05.670
Don't push us too far.

220
11:05.870 --> 11:07.600
My dad died in the line of duty.

221
11:07.910 --> 11:08.700
And you're in such a hurry

222
11:08.700 --> 11:09.440
to kick us out?

223
11:09.440 --> 11:11.030
Don't put it that way.

224
11:11.120 --> 11:12.700
I'm in a tough spot, too.

225
11:12.760 --> 11:14.650
The eviction notice has been issued.

226
11:14.650 --> 11:15.560
I can only do

227
11:15.580 --> 11:16.910
what the bosses tell me.

228
11:17.630 --> 11:18.790
You have two hours.

229
11:19.030 --> 11:19.960
Get moving.

230
11:20.390 --> 11:21.450
Do you understand?

231
11:47.630 --> 11:48.180
Are you in or not?

232
11:48.180 --> 11:48.910
Come on, are you in?

233
11:48.910 --> 11:49.840
Are you in or not?

234
11:50.320 --> 11:51.600
Why is that fish dead?

235
11:51.790 --> 11:53.210
What dead fish?

236
11:54.840 --> 11:56.040
I was seeing things.

237
11:56.120 --> 11:57.440
Ying, play your cards.

238
11:57.440 --> 11:59.100
Nine, ten, jack, queen, king.

239
11:59.320 --> 12:00.170
You're out of cards again?

240
12:00.170 --> 12:01.550
Come on, stick it on! Stick it on!

241
12:01.550 --> 12:02.510
You're cheating!

242
12:02.510 --> 12:03.150
No cheating! No cheating!

243
12:03.150 --> 12:04.030
You're cheating!

244
12:04.030 --> 12:05.360
You're all ganging up on me!

245
12:05.360 --> 12:06.350
No cheating!

246
12:08.750 --> 12:09.680
Come on, come on.

247
13:14.490 --> 13:15.670
[Fengxia's Convenience Store]

248
13:15.630 --> 13:16.200
Ying!

249
13:16.510 --> 13:17.320
Ying, over here! Here! Here!

250
13:17.320 --> 13:18.000
Here! Here!

251
13:18.170 --> 13:20.400
[Fengxia's Convenience Store]

252
13:24.510 --> 13:25.080
Come on. Hurry.

253
13:25.080 --> 13:26.540
Give it to me. Give it here.

254
13:26.840 --> 13:27.620
Look...

255
13:27.930 --> 13:29.530
You just showed up like this?

256
13:29.790 --> 13:30.910
Give me your things. Give them here.

257
13:30.910 --> 13:32.440
This way, this way. Come on.

258
13:37.510 --> 13:39.080
Put them down. Put them down.

259
13:39.080 --> 13:40.940
Put them down. I'll open the door.

260
13:41.320 --> 13:42.360
Come on in.

261
13:50.330 --> 13:51.270
Here, give me your things.

262
13:51.270 --> 13:52.550
Give them here. Give them here.

263
13:52.550 --> 13:53.270
Just put them here.

264
13:53.270 --> 13:54.000
Right here.

265
13:54.770 --> 13:56.660
Come on. Come on.

266
13:58.320 --> 13:59.440
Wait here for me.

267
13:59.440 --> 14:00.270
I'll go downstairs

268
14:00.270 --> 14:01.730
and bring up your luggage.

269
14:14.480 --> 14:16.230
Dad. Mom.

270
14:19.030 --> 14:20.480
We've moved to a new home.

271
14:21.670 --> 14:22.670
Don't worry.

272
14:23.670 --> 14:25.360
I'll take good care of Shan.

273
14:26.360 --> 14:27.150
Mom.

274
14:29.550 --> 14:31.080
I just don't understand...

275
14:33.270 --> 14:33.940
why you

276
14:33.970 --> 14:35.650
had to leave us

277
14:37.270 --> 14:38.630
this way?

278
14:48.620 --> 14:49.430
Mr. Qi.

279
14:51.440 --> 14:53.000
When I went to buy food,

280
14:53.000 --> 14:54.870
there was a car parked downstairs.

281
14:54.870 --> 14:55.840
I've seen the guy

282
14:55.870 --> 14:57.470
sitting in it at the teahouse

283
14:57.480 --> 14:58.870
with Wan Yang a few times.

284
14:58.870 --> 14:59.750
I'm guessing

285
14:59.750 --> 15:01.000
Wan Yang sent him

286
15:01.120 --> 15:02.200
to watch you two.

287
15:05.750 --> 15:06.460
For the next few days,

288
15:06.460 --> 15:07.740
let's stay put

289
15:08.110 --> 15:09.640
and see what they're after.

290
15:10.080 --> 15:10.550
Right.

291
15:10.550 --> 15:12.080
Is he downstairs right now?

292
15:12.080 --> 15:13.150
Yes.

293
15:14.150 --> 15:15.390
-Shan. -Shan!

294
15:15.410 --> 15:16.000
-Can you -Shan.

295
15:16.000 --> 15:17.080
stop being so impulsive?

296
15:17.080 --> 15:18.670
He's gone too far.

297
15:19.550 --> 15:20.820
Listen to me.

298
15:23.000 --> 15:23.790
Eat.

299
15:25.550 --> 15:26.360
Eat.

300
15:28.320 --> 15:29.120
Eat.

301
15:29.320 --> 15:30.360
Listen to Ying. Listen to Ying.

302
15:30.360 --> 15:31.730
Come on, let's eat. Let's eat.

303
15:31.730 --> 15:32.530
Eat.

304
15:34.840 --> 15:36.270
Mr. Qi, have a seat.

305
15:36.290 --> 15:37.490
Thank you. Thank you.

306
15:40.120 --> 15:40.870
Let me do it.

307
16:10.050 --> 16:11.610
Wan Yang sent you, right?

308
16:13.480 --> 16:14.680
Take me to him.

309
16:38.360 --> 16:39.150
Mr. Qi.

310
16:40.000 --> 16:40.790
Mr. Qi.

311
16:41.600 --> 16:42.320
Mr. Qi!

312
16:42.320 --> 16:43.830
Coming! Coming!

313
16:44.620 --> 16:46.150
Is Shan here with you?

314
16:46.920 --> 16:48.890
Why would he be here?

315
16:49.800 --> 16:51.600
W-What's wrong? What happened?

316
16:52.030 --> 16:53.080
Shan is missing.

317
16:53.080 --> 16:54.200
W-What?

318
16:54.790 --> 16:57.130
Wait. Give me a second.

319
16:57.910 --> 16:58.720
Chen Ying.

320
17:00.000 --> 17:00.790
Shan.

321
17:02.670 --> 17:03.480
Chen Ying.

322
17:03.910 --> 17:04.720
Chen Ying.

323
17:06.109 --> 17:07.190
Sir!

324
17:07.920 --> 17:08.710
Sir.

325
17:09.880 --> 17:11.310
What do you want at this hour?

326
17:11.310 --> 17:12.440
I need to make a call.

327
17:23.109 --> 17:24.589
He isn't answering.

328
17:27.640 --> 17:29.040
He won't answer my calls.

329
17:29.350 --> 17:30.160
What do I do?

330
17:30.550 --> 17:32.550
What if something happened to Shan?

331
17:32.930 --> 17:34.530
If something happens to him,

332
17:34.750 --> 17:35.640
what will I do?

333
17:36.750 --> 17:37.550
Chen Ying.

334
17:38.030 --> 17:39.230
Don't panic just yet.

335
17:39.270 --> 17:40.190
He's a grown man.

336
17:40.190 --> 17:41.590
What could possibly happen to him?

337
17:41.590 --> 17:43.270
Well, I'll stay with you.

338
17:43.270 --> 17:43.750
I'll stay with you.

339
17:43.750 --> 17:45.030
We'll wait for him right here.

340
17:45.030 --> 17:45.590
What if

341
17:45.830 --> 17:47.070
he comes back soon?

342
17:47.350 --> 17:47.900
Maybe

343
17:47.930 --> 17:49.360
he'll call you back soon.

344
17:52.200 --> 17:53.000
Don't worry.

345
17:53.110 --> 17:54.200
Don't worry, okay?

346
17:55.070 --> 17:56.000
Trust me.

347
17:56.400 --> 17:57.350
He's got Master.

348
17:58.030 --> 17:59.430
Master will protect him.

349
18:04.680 --> 18:05.640
Three of Characters.

350
18:05.640 --> 18:06.440
Four bamboo.

351
18:07.070 --> 18:08.070
Easy, bro.

352
18:12.720 --> 18:13.590
Chen Shan!

353
18:13.650 --> 18:15.220
This isn't a place for you to cause trouble.

354
18:15.220 --> 18:16.350
Cut the crap.

355
18:19.270 --> 18:20.070
Wan Yang.

356
18:20.680 --> 18:22.340
You sent this guy, didn't you?

357
18:25.590 --> 18:27.070
Is he from our plant?

358
18:27.090 --> 18:27.960
I don't know him.

359
18:27.960 --> 18:28.680
I don't know him.

360
18:28.680 --> 18:29.000
I don't know him.

361
18:29.000 --> 18:30.130
I've never seen him.

362
18:30.240 --> 18:32.200
What's your name? Do you know me?

363
18:33.160 --> 18:34.880
I don't... I don't know you.

364
18:34.880 --> 18:35.810
I don't know him.

365
18:37.030 --> 18:37.830
Get out.

366
18:40.440 --> 18:41.030
Let's go.

367
18:44.920 --> 18:45.720
Kid.

368
18:46.690 --> 18:48.290
You're being too impulsive.

369
18:48.880 --> 18:50.590
If your wallet goes missing tomorrow,

370
18:50.590 --> 18:52.750
are you going to accuse me of stealing that, too?

371
18:52.750 --> 18:54.240
Stop assuming the worst.

372
18:55.110 --> 18:56.040
Go investigate.

373
18:56.680 --> 18:58.160
Do your parents' deaths

374
18:58.310 --> 18:59.840
have anything to do with me?

375
19:00.750 --> 19:02.750
You've got enough family problems.

376
19:02.830 --> 19:05.030
You and Ying need each other.

377
19:05.550 --> 19:07.000
Life isn't easy.

378
19:07.440 --> 19:08.270
Director Wan.

379
19:09.160 --> 19:10.760
Don't play the saint with me.

380
19:11.350 --> 19:13.240
I came here today to tell you this:

381
19:13.720 --> 19:16.160
If you've got a problem with us, take it up with me.

382
19:16.160 --> 19:17.590
Leave Ying out of it.

383
19:18.680 --> 19:20.000
If you dare send anyone else

384
19:20.000 --> 19:21.240
to watch our family,

385
19:22.030 --> 19:23.830
I'll take down every one of them.

386
19:37.590 --> 19:38.410
How about finding someone

387
19:38.410 --> 19:39.610
to teach him a lesson?

388
19:41.550 --> 19:42.350
Go back.

389
20:09.110 --> 20:10.790
I was at the pool hall last night.

390
20:10.790 --> 20:12.400
I'm heading to my godfather's now.

391
20:12.400 --> 20:13.160
Don't worry.

392
20:38.240 --> 20:39.480
Shan's been found.

393
20:41.000 --> 20:42.860
He was at the pool hall last night.

394
20:43.110 --> 20:44.960
He's at his godfather's now.

395
20:45.110 --> 20:46.110
Okay, okay, okay.

396
20:46.110 --> 20:46.830
It's good you found him.

397
20:46.830 --> 20:48.030
It's good you found him.

398
20:48.030 --> 20:49.200
Thanks, Mr. Qi.

399
20:49.220 --> 20:50.640
You should hurry home and sleep.

400
20:50.640 --> 20:52.270
Look at the time. Well,

401
20:52.440 --> 20:54.240
you haven't eaten anything, have you?

402
20:54.240 --> 20:55.030
How about

403
20:55.110 --> 20:56.510
I make you something to eat?

404
20:56.510 --> 20:57.440
Come on, come on.

405
20:59.880 --> 21:00.880
Come on. Let's go.

406
21:10.000 --> 21:10.790
Shan.

407
21:11.970 --> 21:12.480
Y-You're drinking?

408
21:12.480 --> 21:14.640
Why are you drinking in broad daylight?

409
21:14.640 --> 21:16.440
I just feel like drinking today.

410
21:18.000 --> 21:19.750
You can't... can't drink like this.

411
21:19.750 --> 21:20.400
Well...

412
21:20.500 --> 21:21.880
Drinking like this in the middle of the day

413
21:21.880 --> 21:23.080
is bad for your liver.

414
21:24.720 --> 21:26.290
I-I know you're upset,

415
21:26.320 --> 21:26.960
but you

416
21:26.980 --> 21:28.690
can't keep sinking like this.

417
21:30.750 --> 21:31.480
Godfather.

418
21:35.590 --> 21:37.070
So much has happened

419
21:38.590 --> 21:40.280
to our family lately,

420
21:40.440 --> 21:42.040
and there's nothing I can do.

421
21:44.510 --> 21:45.960
I'm completely useless.

422
21:46.110 --> 21:47.170
I-I think no matter

423
21:47.510 --> 21:49.400
how much you or I are hurting,

424
21:49.590 --> 21:51.120
Ying has suffered far more.

425
21:52.310 --> 21:55.440
Both her biological parents and adoptive parents—

426
21:55.440 --> 21:56.550
your mom and dad—

427
21:56.640 --> 21:58.240
have all left her, one by one.

428
21:59.440 --> 22:00.600
Just think about it.

429
22:00.620 --> 22:02.070
Who could possibly bear that kind of pain?

430
22:02.070 --> 22:02.790
Godfather.

431
22:04.550 --> 22:06.200
Do you know about Ying's

432
22:06.200 --> 22:08.070
birth parents?

433
22:09.440 --> 22:10.200
What really happened

434
22:10.200 --> 22:11.730
in the northwest back then?

435
22:15.660 --> 22:16.440
It was just...

436
22:16.440 --> 22:18.350
just an accident.

437
22:19.070 --> 22:20.590
With the kind of work you do,

438
22:20.590 --> 22:21.550
no matter how careful you are

439
22:21.550 --> 22:22.950
about workplace safety,

440
22:23.240 --> 22:24.720
some accidents

441
22:24.720 --> 22:26.120
are simply unavoidable.

442
22:26.750 --> 22:27.830
When that incident

443
22:27.830 --> 22:28.830
happened,

444
22:30.070 --> 22:31.800
your parents were devastated.

445
22:32.000 --> 22:32.750
They were in

446
22:32.750 --> 22:34.240
a terrible mental state.

447
22:35.270 --> 22:36.070
And

448
22:36.480 --> 22:37.510
Ying suddenly

449
22:37.510 --> 22:39.000
became an orphan.

450
22:39.070 --> 22:39.880
She had no one.

451
22:40.790 --> 22:41.860
That's when your parents

452
22:41.860 --> 22:43.000
adopted her.

453
22:45.480 --> 22:46.270
Honestly,

454
22:48.110 --> 22:49.170
even though you and Ying

455
22:49.170 --> 22:50.280
aren't related by blood,

456
22:50.280 --> 22:52.000
you grew up together.

457
22:52.030 --> 22:53.890
You're as close as real siblings.

458
22:54.070 --> 22:56.130
So you... you have to take care of her.

459
22:56.790 --> 22:57.420
Because you're

460
22:57.420 --> 22:59.150
the only man left in the family.

461
22:59.400 --> 23:00.340
No matter how

462
23:00.360 --> 23:01.800
much pain you're in,

463
23:01.830 --> 23:02.620
or how much

464
23:02.650 --> 23:03.850
you've been wronged,

465
23:04.620 --> 23:05.740
you have to be strong for her.

466
23:05.740 --> 23:06.670
You understand?

467
23:10.350 --> 23:11.210
Enough. You...

468
23:11.680 --> 23:12.830
Y-You, you...

469
23:16.880 --> 23:17.510
All right. All right.

470
23:17.510 --> 23:17.920
Well,

471
23:17.920 --> 23:18.960
let me... let me

472
23:18.980 --> 23:19.960
make us a few dishes.

473
23:19.960 --> 23:20.510
I'll cook something for us.

474
23:20.510 --> 23:21.880
And then drink with you.

475
23:22.070 --> 23:23.480
Stop drinking for now.

476
23:23.480 --> 23:23.960
Wait here.

477
23:23.960 --> 23:25.480
You can't just drink like that.

478
23:25.480 --> 23:26.310
It'll hurt your health.

479
23:26.310 --> 23:27.440
All right? I'll drink with you.

480
23:27.440 --> 23:28.700
I will drink with you.

481
24:02.590 --> 24:03.400
Thanks.

482
24:03.750 --> 24:05.070
I didn't make too much.

483
24:05.200 --> 24:06.860
Just have some of this for now.

484
24:23.270 --> 24:25.680
It tastes just like the noodles Dad used to make.

485
24:25.680 --> 24:26.700
Chen Fu noodles.

486
24:28.400 --> 24:30.330
Your dad taught me how to make them.

487
24:30.880 --> 24:32.540
When I first joined the plant,

488
24:32.590 --> 24:34.650
I barely had anything to eat or drink.

489
24:35.000 --> 24:36.800
Your dad always made this for me.

490
24:37.240 --> 24:38.640
Later, I met Master.

491
24:41.160 --> 24:42.560
He and his wife treated me

492
24:43.590 --> 24:45.160
just like their own son.

493
24:48.550 --> 24:50.030
But they're both gone now.

494
24:52.270 --> 24:53.240
Actually,

495
24:54.160 --> 24:55.640
my dad is gone, too.

496
24:58.950 --> 25:00.320
I know what you're

497
25:00.920 --> 25:02.320
going through right now.

498
25:04.480 --> 25:05.270
We'll

499
25:06.640 --> 25:08.170
get through this together.

500
25:32.870 --> 25:35.050
[Wugang Petrochemical Plant]

501
25:38.640 --> 25:40.600
You two, wait a minute.

502
25:40.830 --> 25:42.630
Where do you think you're going?

503
25:43.270 --> 25:44.930
How many times have I told you?

504
25:44.960 --> 25:46.440
Former employees aren't allowed

505
25:46.440 --> 25:47.720
on plant grounds without authorization.

506
25:47.720 --> 25:49.480
You know the rules, right?

507
25:50.200 --> 25:51.790
We're here for my mom's belongings.

508
25:51.790 --> 25:53.070
We'll leave when we're done.

509
25:53.070 --> 25:54.720
Don't you understand

510
25:54.740 --> 25:55.550
what I'm saying?

511
25:55.550 --> 25:57.730
I said no entry means no entry.

512
25:59.160 --> 26:00.160
Didn't Zhang Wenying

513
26:00.160 --> 26:01.370
have a student?

514
26:01.390 --> 26:02.030
How come he didn't come

515
26:02.030 --> 26:02.790
with you?

516
26:02.790 --> 26:04.350
Did he cut ties with you

517
26:04.350 --> 26:05.200
to make it clear where he stands?

518
26:05.200 --> 26:06.310
What's it to you?

519
26:08.070 --> 26:08.590
Right.

520
26:08.880 --> 26:10.140
It doesn't concern me.

521
26:10.160 --> 26:11.720
But whether you enter this gate

522
26:11.720 --> 26:13.000
does concern me.

523
26:13.000 --> 26:14.160
As long as I'm here today,

524
26:14.160 --> 26:15.480
you aren't getting inside.

525
26:15.480 --> 26:16.200
Are you trying to drive us

526
26:16.200 --> 26:17.310
to our deaths?

527
26:18.040 --> 26:19.400
I'm going in today, no matter what!

528
26:19.400 --> 26:20.030
I said you're not going in.

529
26:20.030 --> 26:20.830
Don't touch Ying!

530
26:20.830 --> 26:21.400
Don't touch Ying!

531
26:21.400 --> 26:21.880
Why won't you let us in?

532
26:21.880 --> 26:22.400
So what if I touch you?

533
26:22.400 --> 26:23.070
What are you doing?

534
26:23.070 --> 26:24.070
Why won't you let us in?

535
26:24.070 --> 26:24.550
Get out!

536
26:24.550 --> 26:25.880
Close the gate! Close it!

537
26:25.880 --> 26:27.270
You think you can just barge in here?

538
26:27.270 --> 26:28.600
Who do you think you are?

539
26:28.830 --> 26:30.480
-What's wrong with you? -You've gone too far!

540
26:30.480 --> 26:31.270
What are you doing?

541
26:31.270 --> 26:32.270
So what if I kick you?

542
26:32.270 --> 26:33.720
Fine. Since you're making such a scene here,

543
26:33.720 --> 26:34.550
nobody gets in today!

544
26:34.550 --> 26:35.160
Come out if you're so tough.

545
26:35.160 --> 26:36.000
Come on! Come out!

546
26:36.000 --> 26:36.590
You people, leave.

547
26:36.590 --> 26:37.640
-Come out! -Shan!

548
26:37.640 --> 26:39.560
Fine. We'll wait this out.

549
26:40.440 --> 26:41.960
Nobody's getting in today.

550
26:41.960 --> 26:43.350
Come on, make way.

551
26:43.750 --> 26:44.400
Come on.

552
26:49.680 --> 26:51.550
Speak of the devil.

553
26:51.550 --> 26:53.550
I knew you wouldn't stay out of this.

554
26:54.110 --> 26:54.920
Department Chief Wang.

555
26:54.920 --> 26:56.310
Please open the gate.

556
26:57.240 --> 26:58.270
You're quite a comedian.

557
26:58.270 --> 26:59.870
Is this any of your business?

558
27:00.440 --> 27:02.200
This is Team Leader Pan,

559
27:02.200 --> 27:02.880
a Party Committee member

560
27:02.880 --> 27:04.590
of the Wugang Industrial Bureau. He's leading the investigation

561
27:04.590 --> 27:06.320
into the Project 713 accident.

562
27:06.920 --> 27:08.740
[Notice of Special Investigation]

563
27:07.400 --> 27:08.510
Please cooperate.

564
27:12.550 --> 27:13.700
Should we open the gate?

565
27:13.700 --> 27:15.100
Open it. Open it. Open it.

566
27:19.450 --> 27:26.800
[Wugang Petrochemical Gas Distribution Plant]

567
27:26.800 --> 27:28.910
[Wugang Petrochemical Plant]

568
27:35.010 --> 27:36.610
Everyone, put your work

569
27:36.630 --> 27:37.400
on hold for a moment.

570
27:37.400 --> 27:39.200
We're from the Project 713 accident

571
27:39.200 --> 27:40.310
investigation team.

572
27:40.310 --> 27:41.810
We'd like to ask you some questions.

573
27:41.810 --> 27:42.980
Please cooperate.

574
27:43.750 --> 27:45.030
Why are you still sitting around?

575
27:45.030 --> 27:46.350
The shipment's here.

576
27:47.240 --> 27:48.000
What are you waiting for?

577
27:48.000 --> 27:49.550
Get moving and unload it.

578
27:50.240 --> 27:50.710
Hurry, hurry, hurry.

579
27:50.710 --> 27:51.910
Hurry, hurry, hurry.

580
27:53.640 --> 27:55.100
You're Mr. Sun Jie, right?

581
27:55.960 --> 27:56.960
I am. And you are?

582
27:57.000 --> 27:58.310
I'm from the Project 713 accident

583
27:58.310 --> 27:59.510
investigation team.

584
27:59.750 --> 28:00.590
My last name is Pan.

585
28:00.040 --> 28:01.430
[Department: Investigation Team] [Name: Pan Minghui]

586
28:01.310 --> 28:02.000
Hello.

587
28:02.200 --> 28:03.110
I hope you'll cooperate.

588
28:03.110 --> 28:03.750
Rest assured.

589
28:03.750 --> 28:05.400
I'll cooperate fully.

590
28:05.510 --> 28:06.360
Why don't you have a seat?

591
28:06.360 --> 28:07.530
I'll come find you when I'm done.

592
28:07.530 --> 28:08.200
All right?

593
28:08.220 --> 28:08.880
Have a seat.

594
28:11.240 --> 28:12.920
What are we supposed to do now?

595
28:14.720 --> 28:16.690
What's going on? Why are there so many people?

596
28:16.690 --> 28:17.270
Exactly.

597
28:17.270 --> 28:19.680
The team went to the plant director's office.

598
28:19.680 --> 28:21.210
Who knows what will happen?

599
28:23.240 --> 28:24.160
Department Chief.

600
28:24.160 --> 28:25.830
Quite a scene, huh?

601
28:26.000 --> 28:27.750
Things are about to change at the plant, aren't they?

602
28:27.750 --> 28:28.810
Watch what you say.

603
28:28.880 --> 28:29.480
Our plant

604
28:29.480 --> 28:31.030
has weathered decades of ups and downs.

605
28:31.030 --> 28:32.200
How many incidents have we had?

606
28:32.200 --> 28:32.880
Yes, yes, yes.

607
28:32.880 --> 28:35.240
Yet the plant director has always managed to stay on top.

608
28:35.240 --> 28:37.370
Nothing will happen this time either.

609
28:37.830 --> 28:39.490
-Okay. -Don't talk nonsense.

610
28:44.640 --> 28:45.400
Mr. Qi.

611
28:46.110 --> 28:46.960
Don't worry.

612
28:47.160 --> 28:49.910
The investigation team will clear Master's name

613
28:49.960 --> 28:51.400
and give you justice.

614
28:59.030 --> 29:00.040
The director's coming out.

615
29:00.040 --> 29:01.070
What's going on?

616
29:04.270 --> 29:05.000
They're here. They're here.

617
29:05.000 --> 29:07.400
They're here. They're here. They're here.

618
29:07.810 --> 29:09.320
I'm sorry. I'm sorry. I'm sorry.

619
29:09.320 --> 29:11.160
Comrades from the investigation team,

620
29:11.160 --> 29:13.110
our plant director

621
29:13.130 --> 29:14.880
has worked tirelessly for this plant.

622
29:14.880 --> 29:15.920
He's devoted his whole life to it.

623
29:15.920 --> 29:18.050
You can't just take him away like this.

624
29:18.240 --> 29:20.480
You owe us

625
29:20.680 --> 29:21.720
an explanation.

626
29:22.070 --> 29:24.070
Cooperate with the investigation.

627
29:28.590 --> 29:29.920
I have an announcement.

628
29:30.480 --> 29:32.550
Following reports from plant employees

629
29:32.550 --> 29:34.400
and a review by the investigation team,

630
29:34.400 --> 29:36.850
Plant Director Wan Yang is suspended effective immediately

631
29:36.850 --> 29:38.550
pending an internal investigation.

632
29:38.550 --> 29:40.950
All other personnel implicated in the case

633
29:41.240 --> 29:43.590
are also suspended pending the investigation.

634
29:43.590 --> 29:45.160
To ensure the normal operation

635
29:45.160 --> 29:46.120
of the plant,

636
29:46.550 --> 29:47.920
Deputy Director Geng Jian

637
29:47.920 --> 29:50.160
will serve as acting plant director.

638
29:50.550 --> 29:51.790
All other departments

639
29:51.790 --> 29:53.720
will also be led by their deputies.

640
29:54.240 --> 29:56.920
We hope everyone will cooperate

641
29:57.000 --> 29:58.440
with our investigation.

642
29:59.070 --> 29:59.880
Thank you.

643
30:00.750 --> 30:01.440
Let's go.

644
30:05.920 --> 30:06.720
Director Wan.

645
30:08.030 --> 30:09.030
Excuse me, make way.

646
30:09.030 --> 30:09.400
Director Wan.

647
30:09.400 --> 30:10.030
Make way.

648
30:25.880 --> 30:26.400
Hello.

649
30:26.880 --> 30:28.960
Is this the Project 713 accident investigation team?

650
30:28.960 --> 30:30.960
I'd like to file a formal, named complaint

651
30:30.960 --> 30:32.230
against Wan Yang, director of the Wugang Petrochemical

652
30:32.230 --> 30:33.630
Gas Distribution Plant.

653
30:34.310 --> 30:36.910
I have important evidence to submit in person.

654
31:00.310 --> 31:01.110
Hello.

655
31:01.750 --> 31:03.680
Congratulations, Director Geng.

656
31:04.270 --> 31:05.720
What are you congratulating me for?

657
31:05.720 --> 31:07.470
You're the plant director now.

658
31:12.790 --> 31:14.590
I'm the director now?

659
31:14.590 --> 31:16.520
Then what about Director Wan Yang?

660
31:16.720 --> 31:18.790
Qi Mo filed a real-name report against Wan Yang.

661
31:18.790 --> 31:20.200
He came here with the investigation team.

662
31:20.200 --> 31:21.880
Wan Yang has been temporarily removed.

663
31:21.880 --> 31:23.960
You're acting as plant director.

664
31:29.200 --> 31:29.750
Okay.

665
31:49.680 --> 31:51.680
-Hello, Director Geng. -Director.

666
31:54.920 --> 31:55.920
Hello, Director.

667
31:56.510 --> 31:57.160
Director.

668
31:58.110 --> 31:59.400
Director, Director.

669
31:59.590 --> 32:01.040
Give it to me. I'll do it.

670
32:01.070 --> 32:01.720
-No need, no need. -Leave it to me.

671
32:01.720 --> 32:02.270
It's fine. It's fine.

672
32:02.270 --> 32:03.470
I'll do it. I'll do it.

673
32:07.020 --> 32:09.180
I know how to handle small things.

674
32:10.880 --> 32:12.480
Why did you ride your bike

675
32:12.510 --> 32:13.510
to work yourself?

676
32:13.590 --> 32:16.050
Didn't the plant assign you a car and driver?

677
32:16.160 --> 32:17.960
They're completely out of line.

678
32:17.960 --> 32:19.270
I'll talk to the plant office.

679
32:19.270 --> 32:20.870
I'll have them arrange a car.

680
32:20.960 --> 32:21.750
No need.

